msgid ""
"The background to passswordless root access is summarised in this statement, "
"that used to be found at ``/etc/sudoers.d/qubes`` in each qube:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/security-in-qubes/vm-sudo.rst:58
#: 18c415b20ab94a0a88f328e9a08c606d
msgid ""
"The core of this statement continues to reflect the views of the Qubes "
"developers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/security-in-qubes/vm-sudo.rst:60
#: 39d85de1178549098b1479a6dadde978
msgid ""
"Passwordless root is provided by the ``qubes-core-agent-passwordless-root`` "
"package."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/security-in-qubes/vm-sudo.rst:62
#: 0a7d7abcb7a04c28bf12a26631b3e8d6
msgid ""
"Details of the implementation are :doc:`here </developer/system/vm-sudo>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/security-in-qubes/vm-sudo.rst:64
#: 92e100cb489d4156ad7c801798d9d50c
msgid ""
":doc:`Minimal templates </user/templates/minimal-templates>`, which are "
"intended for use by advanced users, do not have this package installed by "
"default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/security-in-qubes/vm-sudo.rst:67
#: aeeb6ba36e68409ba8f54ccf2f9d7d3b
msgid "Replacing passwordless root access"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/security-in-qubes/vm-sudo.rst:69
#: 7e5c5dead6ab4a65bd1ee512d0ea43a2
msgid ""
"Some users may wish to modify their system by enabling user/root isolation "
"in qubes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/security-in-qubes/vm-sudo.rst:71
#: ab650f87838a412481a18671a19ce8a4
msgid ""
"We do not support this in any packages, but users are free to remove the "
"qubes-core-agent-passwordless-root package if they wish, using standard "
"packaging tools."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/security-in-qubes/vm-sudo.rst:74
#: 47852af3605c4ccb9c314dd52d962311
msgid ""
"Root access can then be gained from dom0 by (e.g) ``qvm-run -u root QUBE "
"qubes-run-terminal``, or ``qvm-console-dispvm QUBE``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/security-in-qubes/vm-sudo.rst:77
#: e2ba15595c714415a208fb255b72b996
msgid "Replacing passwordless root access with Dom0 user prompt"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/security-in-qubes/vm-sudo.rst:79
#: 73789190fbc54be48be81274dc09258b
msgid ""
"An alternative approach is to enable user/root isolation by using a dom0 "
"generated prompt."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/security-in-qubes/vm-sudo.rst:81
#: 4c14d799ea7d46bfa946b103ec24669a
msgid ""
"A list of steps to do so is provided in the `Qubes community guide, "
"Replacing passwordless root with a dom0 prompt <https://forum.qubes-os.org/t/"
"replacing-passwordless-root-with-a-dom0-prompt/19074>`__ **without any "
"guarantee of safety, accuracy, or completeness. Proceed at your own risk. Do "
"not rely on this for extra security.**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/security-in-qubes/vm-sudo.rst:85
#: b5d71ab77ee448ceb7873d36f16d8fe4
msgid "Dom0 passwordless root access"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/security-in-qubes/vm-sudo.rst:87
#: d6feb68c9a37452fbc9fc1009271e559
msgid "There is also passwordless user->root access in dom0."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/security-in-qubes/vm-sudo.rst:89
#: 57b075a39ef546b68c7e000794a76850
msgid ""
"As stated in the comment in ``/etc/sudoers.d/qubes`` there is really no "
"point in user/root isolation in dom0, because all user data (and the whole "
"Qubes management interface) is already accessible to the user, so there is "
"nothing more to be gained from the dom0 root account."
msgstr ""
